    24	| Keep reading | Ch. 55, fifth volley through “He did not get up”; Ch. 58 close, currently replaced by the S23 placeholder | **7** — the pass compels, but the missing chapter-closing exchange breaks the promised payoff | **8** — strong local consequences and a powerful next threshold, reduced by release-text gaps | High / High |
