    23	
    24	The pass necessarily retains extensive prescribed choreography: the slanted wall, seven volleys, falling rig and pine, swept scree, Seln's climb, the death, Force use, stair, retreat, wall release, burial, and far-mouth realization. Those facts are not findings where the manuscript tells them anew. The same exclusion applies to the deliberately prescribed inward reading, instrument trend, court measurements and reactions, centre findings, returns, ledger, letter, departures, and closing prose.
