- Teague's grief and after-next-thaw return; Oryn's three holds and after-thaw map term; Cleon under Treswick; faceless faction; Seln's undecided case; Cael's two acquisition debts all remain live (`chapter-56.md:3–59`; `chapter-57.md:3–99`; `chapter-60.md:103–265`; `BOOK_MAP.md:40–45,490`).

